recommend keep-going mend_the_plan stands in 36 rungs at 178 lines apiece under one hash -- 6,230 carried, the largest single fold this arc has had, and its shape is already measured by a meter that will keep measuring it. Verify each reached symbol stands pub across all thirty-six before a line moves, as every fold here has done.
